#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/2-drag_teleop.md:3
#: 03f6d7ab1b3142608c40cf6e2da80145
msgid ""
"Master–slave **isomorphic teleop** (同构遥操作) for HT Panthera dual-arm. Not a "
"drag-teaching / record-playback stack."
msgstr "面向 HT Panthera 双臂的主从 **同构遥操作**。不是拖动示教 / 录制回放栈。"

